# Line endings are part of the contract here.
#
# scripts/generate_marketplaces.py emits catalogs with LF and CI byte-compares them
# against the canonical source. If Git rewrote them to CRLF on checkout, drift
# detection would fire on every Windows clone for a reason that has nothing to do
# with content. So generated and validated files are pinned to LF everywhere.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.json  text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.toml  text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
